# Ask Chef AI — Context-Aware Multilingual Cooking Assistant

Add a premium "Ask Chef AI" chatbot feature to the AI Recipe Generator. After a recipe is generated (or when viewing a saved recipe), users can chat with an AI chef that automatically knows the recipe context, uploaded image, ingredients, and nutrition data. Includes voice input, text-to-speech, and multilingual support for 6 languages.

