### Component 3: Chef AI API Routes

#### [NEW] [chef_ai.py](file:///f:/Projects/Recipe-Generation-from-Food-Image/Foodimg2Ing/chef_ai.py)

Flask Blueprint `chef_ai_bp` with these routes:

| Route | Method | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `/chef-ai/chat` | POST | Main chat endpoint. Accepts JSON: `{message, result_id, recipe_id, language, session_id, include_image}`. Returns `{response, session_id}` |
| `/chef-ai/history/<session_id>` | GET | Retrieve chat history for a session (auth required) |
| `/chef-ai/sessions` | GET | List user's chat sessions (auth required) |

**Chat endpoint logic:**
1. Resolve recipe context from either `result_id` (in-memory `_TEMP_RESULTS`) or `recipe_id` (DB `SavedRecipe`)
2. Fetch last 10 messages from DB (or session for guests)
3. Build Gemini prompt with Chef AI system prompt + recipe context + history
4. Call `chef_ai_service.chat()`
5. Save user message + AI response to DB (or session)
6. Return JSON response

