### Component 10: Multilingual Support

Handled entirely through Gemini prompt engineering — no manual translation needed:

- The language selector sends a `language` code with each chat request
- The Chef AI service appends to the system prompt: `"You MUST respond entirely in {language_name}. Do not mix languages."`
- Language map: `{en: "English", ml: "Malayalam", hi: "Hindi", ta: "Tamil", te: "Telugu", kn: "Kannada"}`
- Voice input and TTS also use the matching language BCP-47 code

